1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,850
And God said,

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:04,350
Let there be a firmament
in the midst of the waters,

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:07,000
and let it divide the waters
from the waters.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,050
And God made the firmament,

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,900
and divided the waters
which were under the firmament

6
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,400
from the waters
which were above the firmament:

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,800
and it was so.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,400
And God called
the firmament Heaven.

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,600
And the evening and the morning
were the second day.
